    <table cellpadding="2" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" align="center">
    <tr>
        <td bgcolor="#bbbbbb" width="1%" nowrap align="center">
            &nbsp;<font color="#ffffff"><b>Description</b></font>&nbsp;
        </td>
        <td>&nbsp;</td>
    </tr>
    </table>

    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p>Create the RoomRadar QC home page with a clean landing page design that explains what the app does and guides users to start searching for available rooms.</p>

<p>Tasks:</p>

<ul>
	<li>Add main heading and app description</li>
	<li>Add “Find Rooms Now” button that links to the Find Rooms page</li>
	<li>Add “How It Works” section</li>
	<li>Add note that availability is based on schedule data, not live occupancy</li>
	<li>Style the page</li>
</ul>




<p>Done When:</p>

<ul>
	<li>Home page displays correctly</li>
	<li>Button routes to /find-rooms</li>
	<li>Page explains the purpose of RoomRadar QC</li>
	<li>Page is styled and responsive</li>
</ul>

            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

    <br/>

    <table cellpadding="2" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" align="center">
    <tr>
        <td bgcolor="#bbbbbb" width="1%" nowrap align="center">
            &nbsp;<font color="#ffffff"><b>Comments</b></font>&nbsp;
        </td>
        <td>&nbsp;</td>
    </tr>
    </table>

    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" class="grid" style="margin: 0;">
                <tr id="comment-header-10068"><td bgcolor="#f0f0f0">
            Comment by  
                                                    
                
        
            <a class="user-hover" rel="712020:10757065-3ef5-4327-949d-84ace9a6dc0e"
                id="word_commented_712020:10757065-3ef5-4327-949d-84ace9a6dc0e"
                href="https://kyrilousnasr.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3A10757065-3ef5-4327-949d-84ace9a6dc0e">
                    Joseph Uwagba
                </a>

                                        <font size="-2">
            [
                <font color="#336699">03/May/26</font>

                            ]
            </font>

        </td></tr>
        <tr id="comment-body-10068"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <p>Looks good overall. The home page clearly explains what RoomRadar QC does and gives users a simple starting point with the “Find Rooms Now” button. I like that the page includes a “How It Works” section because it helps users understand the process before searching.</p>

<p>Make sure the “Find Rooms Now” button routes correctly to <tt>/find-rooms</tt>. Also, the note about availability being based on schedule data and not live room occupancy is important, so it should be easy to see. The page should also be tested on mobile and desktop to confirm the design is responsive.</p>

<p>Overall, this meets the main goal of introducing the app and guiding users to start finding available rooms.</p>
        </td></tr>
            </table>
<hr class='fullcontent'><br /><br style='page-break-before:always;'/><br />
