    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p>The <tt>/find-rooms</tt> page is reachable and includes the required Material UI controls, validation, and result cards. However, the search currently uses hardcoded mock data and does not apply the selected building or duration. This means users see the same room results regardless of search criteria.</p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

