    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <h3><a name="Summary"></a>Summary</h3>

<p>The room search page needs to be connected to the backend API. This will allow it to display real available rooms instead of using hardcoded data.</p>

<h3><a name="Context"></a>Context</h3>

<p>Currently, the room search page shows hardcoded room data. This needs to be updated to reflect actual available rooms from the database.</p>

<h3><a name="Acceptancecriteria"></a>Acceptance criteria</h3>

<ul>
	<li><tt>FindRooms.jsx</tt> fetches from <tt>GET <a href="http://localhost:5000/api/rooms/search" class="external-link" rel="nofollow noreferrer">http://localhost:5000/api/rooms/search</a></tt></li>
	<li>Passes <tt>day</tt>, <tt>starttime</tt>, <tt>endtime</tt>, <tt>building</tt> as query params</li>
	<li>Displays real rooms returned from the backend</li>
	<li>Remove <tt>mockRooms</tt> hardcoded array</li>
</ul>


<h3><a name=""></a></h3>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

