    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <h3><a name="Summary"></a>Summary</h3>

<p>Connect the Room Details Page to the backend API to display the real schedule for a room.</p>

<h3><a name="Context"></a>Context</h3>

<p>This feature allows students to view the actual schedule for a room when they click "View Schedule".</p>

<h3><a name="Acceptancecriteria"></a>Acceptance criteria</h3>

<ul>
	<li><tt>RoomDetails.jsx</tt> fetches from <tt>GET <a href="http://localhost:5000/api/rooms/" class="external-link" rel="nofollow noreferrer">http://localhost:5000/api/rooms/</a>&lt;id&gt;/schedule</tt></li>
	<li>Passes <tt>day</tt> as a query param</li>
	<li>Displays real course name, instructor, start time, and end time</li>
	<li>Remove hardcoded schedule data</li>
</ul>


<h3><a name=""></a></h3>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

