        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p>QA / Feature Review - Needs Minor Fixes</p>


<p>The AdminDashboard page is implemented and mostly satisfies the requested feature. It is reachable at <tt>/admin-dashboard</tt>, uses a centered Material UI card, provides semester dropdowns, accepts CSV uploads, shows loading/success/error messages, and sends <tt>FormData</tt> to the backend semester upload endpoint.</p>
